/**

 * Optional, isolated adapters for Google + Firebase services.

 * - Lazy loaded (dynamic import)

 * - Wrapped in try/catch

 * - Feature-flagged

 * - No-op fallbacks

 *

 * NOTE: Drop-in utility; it does not alter existing SCRE logic.

